00:23:59.230 --> 00:24:02.376
Pyongyang control. Pyongyang control.

331
00:24:02.400 --> 00:24:05.150
this is Japan airways 351.

332
00:24:05.820 --> 00:24:07.070
Radio check.

333
00:24:22.380 --> 00:24:26.276
Japan airways 351. this is
