428
00:29:59.840 --> 00:30:03.116
But there are more than a
hundred lives on the line here.

429
00:30:03.140 --> 00:30:07.446
So shouldn't we approach this
from a humanitarian perspective

430
00:30:07.470 --> 00:30:08.930
