440
00:30:34.170 --> 00:30:36.356
They're not some
miracle workers. are they?

441
00:30:36.380 --> 00:30:39.936
In the end. they'll have
no choice but to give in.

442
00:30:39.960 --> 00:30:42.736
The South Korean
government never admitted

443
