459
00:31:34.020 --> 00:31:35.230
I repeat.

460
00:31:36.600 --> 00:31:38.730
We need air in the cabin.

461
00:31:39.480 --> 00:31:41.756
The engines have shut down…

462
00:31:41.780 --> 00:31:44.830
